-*   **Density Network ($MLP_{\sigma_k}$):** Takes encoded canonical point $\psi_k(x)$ as input [S1]. Outputs density $\sigma_k$ and feature vector $z$ [S1].
-*   **Color Network ($MLP_{c_k}$):** Takes feature vector $z$, viewing direction $d$, and latent embedding $l_t$ (for frame $t$) as input [S1]. Outputs color $c_k$ [S1].
-
-### Numbered Steps
